{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人鄭家華於節目中推介快手(1024)，一來股份極度超賣，再創逾一年低位，但仍然憧憬分拆可靈AI上市，到時或會突然挾淡倉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1323.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026G0ASAs390l1788166065.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鄭家華建議現價即約32.82元買入，目標價上望42.38元，若失守29.33元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">快手(1024)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$32.82</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$42.38</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$29.33</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1324.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20265wQvswGxim1788166133.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人莫灝楠推介任天堂(NTDOY)，主要是記憶體上升預期降溫，利好遊戲主機業務，加上股價已回落至Switch 2未發售時的水平，估值相對吸引。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1325.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026FSNKT4A66P1788166152.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">莫灝楠建議周一開市便可以吸納，目標價看15.8美元，止蝕價定於13.2美元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">任天堂(NTDOY)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：周一開市價</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：15.8美元</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：13.2美元</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1326.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026gQlAE05a8p1788166163.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T09:18:41.348375+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}